<title>CANADA: NOVA CEO takes aim at rival gas pipelines.</title>
<headline>NOVA CEO takes aim at rival gas pipelines.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NOVA Corp chief executive Ted Newall said he expected new rival gas pipeline proposals to come forward in Alberta over the next year, but pledged to fight each one head-on by stressing NOVA's advantages to producers.</p>
<p>&quot;It's likely that there will be more than one of these types of situations emerge over the next six to 12 months and we will deal with them one by one,&quot; Newall told analysts in a conference call on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
